# Vercel's CLI excludes node_modules from uploads by default. Metro emits the app's web font
# assets under dist/assets/node_modules/@expo-google-fonts/... and @expo/vector-icons/..., so
# that default silently drops every custom font and icon font - the app deploys, but headings
# fall back to system sans and icons render as blank boxes. Re-include them.
!node_modules
!assets/node_modules
